error[E0181]: <Grid> is generic, and its attributes don't give its type parameter V
  --> err_geninfer_pin.vuka:26:3
   |
26 |         <Grid rows={users} />
   |         ^^^^^
   |
   = help: set value={…}, whose type func(T) V gives V, or write the type arguments in the tag
   = help: did you mean <Grid[User, V]>?

error[E0181]: <List>'s items is []User, which makes T User, but the tag writes T as string
  --> err_geninfer_pin.vuka:27:17
   |
27 |         <List[string] items={users} />
   |                       ^^^^^
   |
   = help: pass a value of type []string, or drop the tag's type arguments to infer them: <List>

error[E0181]: <Box>'s value is User, which makes T User, but the tag writes T as int
  --> err_geninfer_pin.vuka:28:13
   |
28 |         <Box[int] value={users[0]} />
   |                   ^^^^^
   |
   = help: pass a value of type int, or drop the tag's type arguments to infer them: <Box>

error[E0181]: <List> is generic, and its attributes don't give its type parameter T
  --> err_geninfer_pin.vuka:29:3
   |
29 |         <List items={nil} />
